 447:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h **** /** \brief Used to configure the selected triggerSet.
 448:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * 1. for IS triggerSet, 4 SRN are configured according to the input provided by the user.
 449:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * 2. for SP triggerSet, sp config provided by the user is configured.
 450:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * 3.for SPA triggerSet, no additional configuration required.
