 728:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief Disables a specific overlay block on the given CPU resource.
 729:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** 
 730:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] cpu          Core no of the CPU. Range: 0 to max number of CPU's supported for the va
 731:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] overlayBlock The identifier of the overlay block to be disabled. Range: 0 to 31.
